<h3>About University Records</h3>
<p>The University Archives is the institutional repository of records that document the history of Barry University. The University Archives collects, process and preserves records of enduring historical value. The collection largely from the founding of the University in 1940 to the present. The Archives make materials accessible and promote their use to the University Community and members of the community beyond the University.</p>
